      "seed": 1406095598,
      "version": 35,
      "versionNonce": 837957270,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781731918967,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**** Request payload content\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**** Request payload content\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4ciLzXgp8fX5R-XC9NduE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 269.7168944805113,
      "y": 1299.1098564832491,
      "width": 1135.2791748046875,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2085523058,
      "version": 690,
      "versionNonce": 1180870090,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781731918967,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Payload contains entire document\n---> Clear document state: recipients know full state of the document the sender is viewing\n---> Cons\n-- Intent is not clear, recipient do not know what changes we made unless compare with their own document revision\n-- not scalable for large documents\n2. Payload contains only changes (the delta)\n-- small request pageload size, document size often has no ipact\n-- Cons: no document state: it's not clear which version of document the changes were made against\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Payload contains entire document\n---> Clear document state: recipients know full state of the document the sender is viewing\n---> Cons\n-- Intent is not clear, recipient do not know what changes we made unless compare with their own document revision\n-- not scalable for large documents\n2. Payload contains only changes (the delta)\n-- small request pageload size, document size often has no ipact\n-- Cons: no document state: it's not clear which version of document the changes were made against\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1gL9Auh650O4VvpddOBBx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 219.8783993834474,
      "y": 1511.675454990684,
      "width": 1355.7791748046875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1404403634,
      "version": 239,
      "versionNonce": 1121645526,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781731918967,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "===> A short response time (under 500ms), WYSIWIS experience, the request should be lightweight and preferred only contains the change",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "===> A short response time (under 500ms), WYSIWIS experience, the request should be lightweight and preferred only contains the change",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eNPIoNuZcmCfmrNaHFPvC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 222.48382216954025,
      "y": 1569.6265433551741,
      "width": 501.2996826171875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b20",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 96345906,
      "version": 64,
      "versionNonce": 593452170,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781731918967,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**** Network architecture and communication model\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**** Network architecture and communication model\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HnJ232eBtAbEHhc2p3rLr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 267.933353989602,
      "y": 1618.2909208876886,
      "width": 957.139404296875,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b21",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 501405938,
      "version": 1080,
      "versionNonce": 1245317398,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781731918967,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Client-server model: central server, all participants communicate with only the server\nPros:\n-- Centralized SoT, database persistency\n-- Robustness: eg: when new participants joins or one of existing client crashes, latest document \ncan be fetched from server\nCons:\n-- Single point of failure \n-- Cost: high infrastructure and maintenance costs \n-- Scalability: can become bottleneck without proper scaling\n2. Peer to peer: each participant as as both client and server (no need for central server)\nPros\n-- Low latency, cost effective and cost distribution\nCons:\n-- Synchronize problem --> difficult to decide latest version, what updates are missing\n-- Complicated consensus: new member has to figure out how to fetch latest document revision\n-- Server is still needed -- since document needs to be persisted to a database\n-- Security -- if 1 participant goes rouge, all will be impact\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Client-server model: central server, all participants communicate with only the server\nPros:\n-- Centralized SoT, database persistency\n-- Robustness: eg: when new participants joins or one of existing client crashes, latest document \ncan be fetched from server\nCons:\n-- Single point of failure \n-- Cost: high infrastructure and maintenance costs \n-- Scalability: can become bottleneck without proper scaling\n2. Peer to peer: each participant as as both client and server (no need for central server)\nPros\n-- Low latency, cost effective and cost distribution\nCons:\n-- Synchronize problem --> difficult to decide latest version, what updates are missing\n-- Complicated consensus: new member has to figure out how to fetch latest document revision\n-- Server is still needed -- since document needs to be persisted to a database\n-- Security -- if 1 participant goes rouge, all will be impact\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tVc7ahJRILXQLZwCRENp0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1254.454886903181,
      "y": 1611.1343947799646,
      "width": 608.5596313476562,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b25",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1081860654,
      "version": 20,
      "versionNonce": 353844042,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781731918967,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "==> client-server model is preferred. \nP2P models are more suitable for applications like video chat, \nwhere request losses can be tolerated \nand not all the data has to be persisted.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "==> client-server model is preferred. \nP2P models are more suitable for applications like video chat, \nwhere request losses can be tolerated \nand not all the data has to be persisted.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "evhnPbKTh7470NvKHECF3",
