      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781739856435,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**** Streaming protocol:\nprogressively download large video file and split into smaller segments\nin sequence. \n***** HLS (HTTP Live streaming)\n***** DASH (dynamic adaptive streaming over HTTP)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**** Streaming protocol:\nprogressively download large video file and split into smaller segments\nin sequence. \n***** HLS (HTTP Live streaming)\n***** DASH (dynamic adaptive streaming over HTTP)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OI8EU9mU_blcH9YCSEJ2f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100.8310492497872,
      "y": 2166.8651678321867,
      "width": 734.3994140625,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b35",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1151790998,
      "version": 502,
      "versionNonce": 1273257430,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781740058731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Video format\n**** WebM\n---- online streaming\n---- limited browser support (Firefox/Chrome/Opeera)\n---- Encoding compression (use VP8/VP9 video codec)\n\n**** MP4\n---- video storage, video auditing/broadcasting/streaming\n---- More browser support\n---- Use H264 (AVC) video codec, highly compressed efficiency, good quality\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Video format\n**** WebM\n---- online streaming\n---- limited browser support (Firefox/Chrome/Opeera)\n---- Encoding compression (use VP8/VP9 video codec)\n\n**** MP4\n---- video storage, video auditing/broadcasting/streaming\n---- More browser support\n---- Use H264 (AVC) video codec, highly compressed efficiency, good quality\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ss0fX-pBqSg6BWbi5Kgyg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 268.2954221178895,
      "y": 2842.6683793299426,
      "width": 1784.8590087890625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b36",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 407004874,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 1276598282,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781740286613,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**** <Video /> tag (JS manipulation include HTMLVideoElement/HTMLMediaElement)\n--- A vanilla <video> with an src attribute is not enough for production\nProgressive download cannot adapt quality to bandwidth, support long-form content without huge upfront transfers, or power features like mid-video ad insertion and live streaming. \nWorld-class playback requires the Media Source API plus an adaptive streaming protocol (DASH or HLS) on top of a custom player UI.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**** <Video /> tag (JS manipulation include HTMLVideoElement/HTMLMediaElement)\n--- A vanilla <video> with an src attribute is not enough for production\nProgressive download cannot adapt quality to bandwidth, support long-form content without huge upfront transfers, or power features like mid-video ad insertion and live streaming. \nWorld-class playback requires the Media Source API plus an adaptive streaming protocol (DASH or HLS) on top of a custom player UI.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
