      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781741135675,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Adaptive bitrate streaming\n--- dynamically adjust quality of video to suit available bandwidth and processing capabilities of the users' device\n--- Factors include: bandwidth, codecs, connection quality, video player dimensions, playback rate\n--- Prioritizing fast startup over initial quality is almost always the right tradeoff: \nusers tolerate a few seconds of lower resolution far better than a blank spinner. \nBegin playback at a rendition that the current bandwidth estimate can clearly sustain, then allow the ABR algorithm to step up once the buffer is healthy.\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Adaptive bitrate streaming\n--- dynamically adjust quality of video to suit available bandwidth and processing capabilities of the users' device\n--- Factors include: bandwidth, codecs, connection quality, video player dimensions, playback rate\n--- Prioritizing fast startup over initial quality is almost always the right tradeoff: \nusers tolerate a few seconds of lower resolution far better than a blank spinner. \nBegin playback at a rendition that the current bandwidth estimate can clearly sustain, then allow the ABR algorithm to step up once the buffer is healthy.\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
